<title>SWEDEN: SCA 1996 result by business areas.</title>
<headline>SCA 1996 result by business areas.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result breakdown by business area for Swedish forestry company Svenska Cellulosa Aktiebolaget (SCA) breakdown for the year Jan 1-Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p> SALES (million skr)			   1996	     1995</p>
<p> Hygiene Products			 24,131	   24,491</p>
<p> Packaging				  13,697	   17,609</p>
<p> Graphic Paper			    15,872	   18,159</p>
<p> Forest and Timber			 3,948	    4,245</p>
<p> Other operations			  1,576		930</p>
<p> Divested units			    1,061	    2,895</p>
<p> Intra-group Deliveries		 -4,880	   -3,012</p>
<p> Total					55,405	   65,317</p>
<p>EARNINGS (million skr)</p>
<p> Hygiene Products			  2,323	    1,366</p>
<p> Packaging				     939	    2,370</p>
<p> Graphic Paper				 510	    2,345</p>
<p> Forest and Timber			   607		877</p>
<p> Other operations			    436		595</p>
<p> Divested units				 54		 98</p>
<p> Goodwill depreciation		    -288	     -301</p>
<p> Total operating profit		  4,581	    7,350</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1003</p>
